  "body": "A great opportunity to build your own dream home on the relatively large of 528 square metres (more or less) freehold section which situated in the such beautiful Gulf Harbour where make you enjoying the lifestyles, boating, fishing and the marvelous beaches.  Bella Vista means beautiful view and this section certainly does have that! Bella Vista Drive community does bring more feelings of privacy. The land is Elevated amongst the most of other properties in Bella. Vendors keen to sell, So do not miss it!  So closed to all amenities in Gulf Harbour Town Center, excellent schools and Ferry terminal. Proudly Nearby world class golf course, fairway bay marina and minutes drive to Shakespeare National Park.\r\nAs a trusted local Master Builder, C1 Homes offers premium house-and-land packages with flexible construction funding through progress payments.\"  - https://www.c1homes.co.nz/portfolios",
